{"name":"Salad","hex":"#8ba673","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"salad","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A food consisting principally of raw vegetables (especially greens, e.g. lettuce), other savoury ingredients (typically cooked), fruit, or confectionary; often involving two or more such ingredients mixed together, with larger items cut or torn into small pieces, and usually with a dressing or binding; usually served cold or at room temperature, as a dish or savoury sandwich filling.","One or more raw vegetables of the kind used in salads; typically greens (especially lettuce)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/salad"}],"entries":[{"title":"Salad","blocks":[{"text":"A salad is a dish consisting of mixed ingredients, frequently vegetables. They are typically served chilled or at room temperature, though some can be served warm. Condiments called salad dressings, which exist in a variety of flavors, are usually used to make a salad."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Salad_platter.jpg/330px-Salad_platter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salad","wikidata":"Q9266"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/A_large_mixed_salad.jpg/500px-A_large_mixed_salad.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/A_large_mixed_salad.jpg/1280px-A_large_mixed_salad.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/A_large_mixed_salad.jpg/500px-A_large_mixed_salad.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A large mixed salad","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AA_large_mixed_salad.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Taboul